{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42629","headline":"和赠和龙妙空禅师 · 夏鸿","name":"和赠和龙妙空禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翰林遗迹镜潭前，孤峭高僧此处禅。\n出爲信门兴化日，坐当吾国太平年。\n身同莹澈尼珠净，语并锋鋩慧劒坚。\n道果已圆名已遂，即看千匝遶香筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"夏鸿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}